  "summary": "Running many AWS accounts safely: AWS Organizations (OUs, consolidated billing, SCPs, RCPs, tag policies), the IAM condition keys and policy types the exam tests (conditions, S3 ARNs, aws:PrincipalOrgID, roles versus resource-based policies, permissions boundaries, evaluation logic), workforce single sign-on with IAM Identity Center, Active Directory options in AWS Directory Service, and governance at scale with AWS Control Tower.",
